## 本目录内容不属于源代码授权范围

`Assets/` 下的全部内容（应用图标、图标集、界面截图、演示动图与视频、宣传图形、角色形象、界面视觉方案）**不随仓库源代码一并授权**。

任何依 `../LICENSE` 第一部分取得的源代码权利，**均不包含**对本目录任何文件的使用权。

The entire contents of `Assets/` (app icons, iconsets, UI screenshots, demo animations and videos, promotional graphics, character designs, and the visual design language of the interface) are **NOT licensed together with the source code**.

No right obtained under Part 1 of `../LICENSE` includes any right to use any file in this directory.

